<title>USA: Schering-Plough Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31: First Quarter    % Change</p>
<p>					   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Sales				$ 1,568.1  $ 1,382.7     13%</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses:</p>
<p>	Cost of Sales		   289.3	262.7	10</p>
<p>Selling, General</p>
<p>	  and Administrative	  593.5	503.3	18</p>
<p>	Research and Development    179.2	162.9	10</p>
<p>	Other, Net			  9.0	 21.2    (58)</p>
<p> Total				  1,071.0	950.1	13</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes	 497.1	432.6	15</p>
<p> Income Taxes			   121.8	106.0	15</p>
<p> Net Income			     375.3	326.6     15%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share:	  1.03	  .89     16%</p>
<p> Effective Tax Rate		   24.5%	24.5%</p>
<p> Avg shrs Outstanding (millions)  365.6	365.7</p>
<p>Actual shrs Outstanding at</p>
<p>     March 31 (in millions)	 365.9	368.4</p>
<p>(Dollars in millions, except per share figures)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Eliminating the impact of foreign currency exchange, earnings per share would have increased approximately 18 percent for the 1996 first quarter.</p>
